# The wave sent downward reflects from the substrate and returns in or out of phase with the upward one.
# Reference: the same two-beam estimate written independently in NumPy.
title Buried oxide 1 um thick
stack core=0.22 box=1.0
grating angle=10 length=30
leak 0.14
substrate on
expect up 0.47600120 1e-07
expect efficiency 0.34639496 2e-05
expect peak_wavelength 1.55156668 0.0002
